# Sample Category Classification

| No | Customer Text | Category | Reason |
|----|---------------|----------|--------|
| 1 | My refund hasn't arrived yet. | Billing | Customer is asking about a refund/payment issue. |
| 2 | I forgot my account password. | Account | Customer has an account access problem. |
| 3 | The application crashes every time I open it. | Technical Issue | Customer reports a technical problem. |
| 4 | When will my package be delivered? | Shipping | Customer asks about delivery status. |
| 5 | I want to upgrade my subscription plan. | Subscription | Customer requests a subscription change. |
